M102 ZEXIY: the file-output ZEXALL with a replaced test table (ZEXIY.COM writes
ZEXIY.TXT): INC/DEC IXH, IXL, IYH and IYL with the FD prefix for IY and each counter on the register under test (the stock iyh/iyl groups execute DD opcodes, and all four stock counters vary the wrong field); derived from incxh, incxl, incyh and incyl.

This patch modifies ZEX and is distributed under the GPL-2.0-or-later terms
stated in external/zex/zexall.src. tools/cpmva/zex/zexbuild.py applies it
after zexall-fileout.patch. msbt and the original descriptors are unchanged.
The expected CRCs of the new groups are those of the Zilog profile.

--- a/external/zex/zexall.src
+++ b/external/zex/zexall.src
@@ -94,7 +94,7 @@
 	ld	c,9
 	call	bdos
 
-	ld	hl,tests	; first test case
+	ld	hl,testsiy	; vaeg ZEXIY: first test case
 loop:	ld	a,(hl)		; end of list ?
 	inc	hl
 	or	(hl)
@@ -109,6 +109,22 @@
 	call	fclose		; vaeg: flush and close the log file
 	jp	0		; warm boot
 
+; vaeg M102 ZEXIY test table: INC/DEC IXH, IXL, IYH and IYL; the IY groups use the FD prefix
+; and every counter varies the register under test (the stock groups
+; execute DD opcodes for IY and vary the wrong field). Every group runs with flag mask
+; D7h and FFh. This addition is distributed under the same GPL-2.0-or-later
+; terms as the rest of this file.
+testsiy:
+	dw	iyxhd7
+	dw	iyxhff
+	dw	iyxld7
+	dw	iyxlff
+	dw	iyyhd7
+	dw	iyyhff
+	dw	iyyld7
+	dw	iyylff
+	dw	0
+
 tests:
 	dw	adc16
 	dw	add16
@@ -711,6 +727,65 @@
